{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "version": "d082336fe1d34e251643455768675effca94a97a184047c222eab1f83ee1dfe2",
  "duration": 264,
  "synthetic": true,
  "voiceSha256": "ca96e53395793aa5164d1f21ce2d9fb8d69ddcdcae5ba0640b2dd751e7f92496",
  "captionsSha256": "1c9439bcac397c89c4f9ac4c5d16eae605f6b13663c2bdf802496cca72ea1d35",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": "q01",
      "text": "机器，为什么能认出一只猫，甚至写下一段代码？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 3.2,
      "end": 7.904,
      "duration": 4.704,
      "key": "eb31c6cc102fc8e04cb4a94679ff3b3408f4073594f0825304798a41cb6abe0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "q02",
      "text": "七十多年前，这还是一个几乎无人能回答的问题。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 9.5,
      "end": 14.108,
      "duration": 4.608,
      "key": "8f7aa967100bd8e0c9868aa6b750531b885bec296edf18e8d5fbd3740ecc5a95"
    },
    {
      "id": "q03",
      "text": "改变世界的，不是一颗突然觉醒的电子大脑。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 15.7,
      "end": 19.636,
      "duration": 3.936,
      "key": "b79c741dd35396789356d642fc874579f3dcc320108058c95e81e983f2d5dc6e"
    },
    {
      "id": "q04",
      "text": "而是，教机器的方法，变了。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 24.68,
      "duration": 3.48,
      "key": "2af75a04bda271760769e297582ccb22ac42b7dfe249bccfeb15a7ae3b0be5b5"
    },
    {
      "id": "q05",
      "text": "一九五零年，图灵提出了机器能否思考的问题。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 26,
      "end": 30.392,
      "duration": 4.392,
      "key": "282dec1eaab5de6283b310ab8456f7a65a93ed0da75e30cace4731d009736241"
    },
    {
      "id": "q06",
      "text": "一九五六年，达特茅斯夏季研究项目，为这个领域命名。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 32.2,
      "end": 37.168000000000006,
      "duration": 4.968,
      "key": "f9a75e82f2330b2ae251730da272471af78c81cb00c91a3011b710b6b123102d"
    },
    {
      "id": "q07",
      "text": "早期的一条路线，是把人的知识，写成机器能执行的规则。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 40,
      "end": 45.328,
      "duration": 5.328,
      "key": "c25b2903d5ed7fb750d65f11fe08885d1b75302a7a5a1c5d8b10c7468aa7dccc"
    },
    {
      "id": "q08",
      "text": "如果是红色，就走左边；如果是方形，就走右边。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 48,
      "end": 53.088,
      "duration": 5.088,
      "key": "b7a1e2e78d9e5f228ae75018b6ba69ac23c8f44b39ab45c44fbc6ff4fc202e23"
    },
    {
      "id": "q09",
      "text": "规则明确时，搜索与推理，能完成令人惊讶的任务。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 55,
      "end": 59.775999999999996,
      "duration": 4.776,
      "key": "28345dca537650b491bc92057108f5d987eafaeac247083ade457ea1901c9145"
    },
    {
      "id": "q10",
      "text": "一九九七年，深蓝在正式比赛中，战胜了国际象棋世界冠军。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 62,
      "end": 67.64,
      "duration": 5.64,
      "key": "f23ae4856dd65b0b212390197d934c76e29486906955e085ea70ee6fdf27be34"
    },
    {
      "id": "q11",
      "text": "但真实世界，有太多没写进规则的例外。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 70,
      "end": 73.912,
      "duration": 3.912,
      "key": "3d2038b002502aea07aa14abc84e3d1fcab407964d18a5698dae7a40fdc24902"
    },
    {
      "id": "q12",
      "text": "另一条路，是让机器从例子里学习。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 76.5,
      "end": 80.148,
      "duration": 3.648,
      "key": "4da6b163c02bbb6f99f6854412910f1d6af721c71166f6a8fee342b1cfe3b664"
    },
    {
      "id": "q13",
      "text": "输入，穿过一层又一层相互连接的计算单元。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 82,
      "end": 86.488,
      "duration": 4.488,
      "key": "d4b3ab0f269f32500c0a65f5ae2ee224b29e74860092895d7060a40e7ba9a700"
    },
    {
      "id": "q14",
      "text": "输出错了，就计算误差，再把调整信号传回去。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 88.5,
      "end": 92.988,
      "duration": 4.488,
      "key": "7e02a4611838e3c7489bb6e4c2817330040e6b297decca565cbece04e22ce926"
    },
    {
      "id": "q15",
      "text": "连接上的数字，叫权重。训练，就是反复调整它们。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 95,
      "end": 100.688,
      "duration": 5.688,
      "key": "f736b1400b93e52642de81acaf44d0b6caeec22f9444d1ed9e2e1f88ee31cf20"
    },
    {
      "id": "q16",
      "text": "一九八六年的反向传播研究，推动了多层网络的训练。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 102,
      "end": 106.68,
      "duration": 4.68,
      "key": "c35967ac18f8d16f99f3d84160d9fd80051e523b70b2db335b1a87cbce8428e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "q17",
      "text": "机器学到的，是数据中可以复用的模式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 109,
      "end": 112.696,
      "duration": 3.696,
      "key": "a875b2fc32b59d7c293e39ed68df36f5d8c7e9cf1bbbd83cb1cd19d3a031ad46"
    },
    {
      "id": "q18",
      "text": "二零一二年，阿列克斯网络，在图像识别竞赛中取得突破。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 120.232,
      "duration": 5.232,
      "key": "29de1ea5065e8fad62065747316750116caf9305d52349c9e98be5d1a94afadd"
    },
    {
      "id": "q19",
      "text": "图像进入网络，局部特征，逐层组合成更复杂的形状。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 122.5,
      "end": 127.78,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "key": "ce0dd90aa822f084a1fb249bfb730a7f6f792f84cdefdffc86c1a1012a1bcfce"
    },
    {
      "id": "q20",
      "text": "大量标注数据，加上图形处理器，让更大的网络变得可训练。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 130,
      "end": 135.832,
      "duration": 5.832,
      "key": "44557c0ca5c288d7b3805968fec9030d482073514344afd0071d61d5eeb2d59c"
    },
    {
      "id": "q21",
      "text": "但识别出关联，不等于人类全部的视觉理解。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 137.5,
      "end": 141.724,
      "duration": 4.224,
      "key": "e52cc524e5e2f8766dfc6f402749c691779ff6d696f69b7d0887946a4bb4efb8"
    },
    {
      "id": "q22",
      "text": "二零一六年，阿尔法狗以四比一，战胜围棋棋手李世石。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 144,
      "end": 149.28,
      "duration": 5.28,
      "key": "50a6978e9a55d371d61ff20b86f66425778495b418a5bc23b1bbd5b080ba4241"
    },
    {
      "id": "q23",
      "text": "它结合神经网络、搜索与强化学习，而非算遍所有棋局。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 151.5,
      "end": 156.924,
      "duration": 5.424,
      "key": "1dbff8dcbb8870203602d6b8144abea46fa09936702f45bcd1e9866d621e8ad1"
    },
    {
      "id": "q24",
      "text": "预测落点，评估局面，再通过对弈不断改进。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 159,
      "end": 163.344,
      "duration": 4.344,
      "key": "7a8663d2a45d20ed6b5a336913bbf47c07d7fa56faabd1d5aaa46fa985848b97"
    },
    {
      "id": "q25",
      "text": "搜索与学习汇合，但它还不是万能智能。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 165,
      "end": 168.84,
      "duration": 3.84,
      "key": "a709252664bcf37bb645a00cf9d69f63f78bea02a63132915ce493a7292f0eb9"
    },
    {
      "id": "q26",
      "text": "二零一七年，变换器架构，改变了序列信息的处理方式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 171,
      "end": 175.968,
      "duration": 4.968,
      "key": "b58ff486b0e50e17548710e59e672e5f4894823ce25ab9047b799de4cdd42cbb"
    },
    {
      "id": "q27",
      "text": "小猫喝了牛奶，因为它饿了。这里的它，指向谁？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 178.5,
      "end": 183.756,
      "duration": 5.256,
      "key": "56e5b6c21fb3848c4af09e7c73b35fdf76fe655b7196a10c10ef013e2821b385"
    },
    {
      "id": "q28",
      "text": "注意力机制，让不同位置的信息，按相关程度重新组合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 185,
      "end": 190.208,
      "duration": 5.208,
      "key": "d65e982a8b1114ad9c37ee201048e2d40d622afacce1e7593ad082dea35d83fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "q29",
      "text": "连线只是示意，实际计算，发生在大量向量之间。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 192.5,
      "end": 197.3,
      "duration": 4.8,
      "key": "39bf8d3f4113fb003e68687216bc893b320110c5029a2e7de2ed991b981a2e8f"
    },
    {
      "id": "q30",
      "text": "并行训练，配合数据与算力，推开了大模型时代的门。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 199,
      "end": 203.872,
      "duration": 4.872,
      "key": "9c4ed9340c07d3a74621807ad8afa34d30dee4970a3d47b337faf139dc2f171b"
    },
    {
      "id": "q31",
      "text": "大语言模型常用的预训练任务，是预测接下来的词元。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 206.5,
      "end": 211.132,
      "duration": 4.632,
      "key": "127fe113a004c9ec8b54aba11eb6a6fcf58d2280269e01ecb577d1390bc40308"
    },
    {
      "id": "q32",
      "text": "反复预测，让网络学习语言，以及语言中记录的许多规律。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 213.5,
      "end": 218.708,
      "duration": 5.208,
      "key": "2d44eb5f447926175b6a2aee2f5e5c5b783f24d22bb8ebf49cba212e1127ffd5"
    },
    {
      "id": "q33",
      "text": "再经过指令训练和反馈优化，模型变得更适合与人协作。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 221,
      "end": 225.992,
      "duration": 4.992,
      "key": "ecd2fdb07b0548fab6446bd8f2ad64446ce764ab7b7921323443c5091081845c"
    },
    {
      "id": "q34",
      "text": "二零二二年，聊天机器人进入大众视野。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 228,
      "end": 232.2,
      "duration": 4.2,
      "key": "0bc3871039b06b1e5d82c5fd28bac10fd5b3430c1361566119c41d37e803c146"
    },
    {
      "id": "q35",
      "text": "文字、图像与声音，开始在同一系统中汇合。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 233.5,
      "end": 238.06,
      "duration": 4.56,
      "key": "6730e42fa79ddde4556fbeed09fd41cad2e485c4822ada6b513eed3569701602"
    },
    {
      "id": "q36",
      "text": "但流畅，不等于真实；更大，也不自动意味着可靠。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 239.5,
      "end": 244.756,
      "duration": 5.256,
      "key": "3a6c70ac37102869e3da76c72f3511c48b160421c54563148c09f24f26160003"
    },
    {
      "id": "q37",
      "text": "从纸上的规则，到会学习的网络，人类拓展了工具的边界。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 246.5,
      "end": 251.564,
      "duration": 5.064,
      "key": "8e91d4a0246499a1004fe2995ffa086bbde1b146328832eb8e5cdb652437a86c"
    },
    {
      "id": "q38",
      "text": "下一步，不只是让机器回答得更多。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 254,
      "end": 257.432,
      "duration": 3.432,
      "key": "47758b6ebfee054850dd79dd5ddd8e287865caeaeae13c2cedc7f3d87b0be199"
    },
    {
      "id": "q39",
      "text": "而是问出更好的问题，并为答案负责。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "provider": "edge",
      "voice": "zh-CN-YunxiNeural",
      "start": 258.7,
      "end": 262.204,
      "duration": 3.504,
      "key": "2ccada1520f2b231e12e350e9602074ca5a34e0b43569dacaafe8f01f7407006"
    }
  ]
}